readme.text:
- a global `tools.guard` denies `mcp__<server>__*` and the three MCP resource tools aimed at that server on the next call;
- every live agent gets a `tools.restrict({ deny })` mask, an empty `mcp:<server>` prompt shadow, a filtered `mcp-resource-servers` list, and a short disabled notice;
- the chip reports the number of hidden tools and an approximate token cost based on the JSON schema size (`bytes / 4`).
